BenchForge

The CARLA, Habitat and LIBERO collectors and portions of BenchForge's
database schema, artifact writing, collection diagnostics, and spatial-question
code are adapted from EurecaMoment/BenchClaw
(https://github.com/EurecaMoment/BenchClaw) under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Adaptations include portable configuration and integration with BenchForge
scene capture and delivery.

DSH integration references the user's installed deepseek-harness runtime and
composes its installed preset definitions. DSH code, model weights, simulator
assets and datasets are not redistributed in this repository.

BenchForge DSH tool definitions and delivery-review modules are imported from
the user-authorized SpatialForge working source (2026-09-29). Service execution,
acceptance rules and GT have not been changed by this client packaging.
